OL,5,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA 53-year-old joiner has fallen
OL,7,     Fthrough the first floor of a
OL,8,     Fbuilding; a 43-year-old man has
OL,9,     Fcut himself in the abdomen with a
OL,10,     Fchainsaw whilst doing DIY and is
OL,11,     Fin a serious condition.
OL,12,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FIn Birmingham, A&E staff deal with
OL,14,     Fa disruptive man refusing to leave
OL,15,     Fhis wheelchair. In Norwich, an air
OL,16,     Fambulance brings in a man who
OL,17,     Fdrunkenly impaled himself on a
OL,18,     Fgraveyard fence.
